warning: `unpack` is deprecated
 --> Lua54:1:1
1 | unpack(t)
  | ^^^^^^^^^
tag: deprecated
help: deprecated in Lua 5.2+; use 'table.unpack' instead
fix: replace deprecated `unpack` with `table.unpack(t)`
  | table.unpack(t)

warning: `table.getn` is deprecated
 --> Lua54:1:11
1 | local n = table.getn(t)
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
tag: deprecated
help: use the '#' length operator instead
suggestion: replace deprecated `table.getn` with `#t`
  | local n = #t

